  "releaseNotes": "- Added workspace composition operations: `copy`, `merge`, and `partition` by table, language, or regex.\n- Added the customizable `model-id prefix` transformation with per-table key-segment selection and reverse conversion.\n- Added official JSON action support alongside YAML, including cross-format `uses`.\n- Renamed the action schema field to `schema-version`; legacy `version` remains supported as an alias.\n- Fixed YAML parsing for empty literal scalars represented as `|-`.",
